      {
        "path": "docs.html",
        "encoding": "utf8",
        "content": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>ReadProxy · 报表接入</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/assets/style.css\"></head><body><header><strong>ReadProxy · 报表接入</strong><small>接口工作台 · 示例业务数据</small></header><main><nav><a href=\"/\">概览</a><a href=\"/docs.html\">接口文档</a><a href=\"/openapi.json\">OpenAPI</a></nav><h1>接口文档</h1><section><p>网关以 X-User-Role 转发身份，可选 viewer/operator。公网入口应覆盖客户端自行提供的同名头；演示接口可直接比较带头与不带头响应。</p><ul><li><a href=\"/api/reports/internal\">内部报表</a> <code>/api/reports/internal</code></li><li><a href=\"/api/gateway/config\">身份转发配置</a> <code>/api/gateway/config</code></li></ul><h2>示例请求</h2><pre>[\n  {\n    &quot;method&quot;: &quot;GET&quot;,\n    &quot;path&quot;: &quot;/api/reports/internal&quot;\n  }\n]</pre></section><footer>演示业务数据 · <a href=\"/receipt-schema.json\">复现记录接口定义</a></footer></main></body></html>"
